    "body": "## Summary\n- add admin API bindings for account-enforcement audit and `SUSPEND_JOB_OWNER`\n- load listing and account sanctions independently for each reviewed report\n- expose a separate destructive suspension control with an optional internal reason\n- replace the control with the persisted target/moderator/timestamp/reason audit after success or reload\n- keep listing cancellation and account suspension as independent, explicit moderation decisions\n\n## Safety / lifecycle\n- the client never supplies a target user id; the backend derives the reported job owner\n- backend protections for ADMIN accounts and active `IN_PROGRESS`, `COMPLETION_REQUESTED` or `DISPUTED` work remain authoritative\n- rejected suspensions surface as errors without mutating local audit state\n- no escrow, tracking or location data is added to the moderation UI\n\n## Validation\nRun frontend lint/build, Maven verify, Flyway/PostgreSQL/runtime smoke and payments-ledger smoke. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
